  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "雲端安全",
    "sub_ename": "CLOUD COMPUTING SECURITY",
    "describe_ch": "雲端運算已發展十多年，其特色與優勢，儼然已成為各企業於發展資訊服務的首選，然而，相關資訊安全事件亦層出不窮，亦成為企業選擇雲端運算的阻礙。本課程將先從雲端運算管理面著手，了解雲端運算環境中各層面應採取的措施，並應用校園AWS環境，進行雲端安全之相關實作；此外將透過最新案例分析，探討雲端安全相關議題。",
    "describe_eh": "Cloud computing has been developed for more than ten years. Its characteristics and advantages have made it the first choice for enterprises in developing information services. However, related information security incidents have also emerged one after another, which has become an obstacle for enterprises to choose cloud computing. This course will start with cloud computing management, understand the measures that should be taken at all levels in the cloud computing environment, and apply the campus AWS environment to carry out relevant practices of cloud security; in addition, it will explore cloud security-related issues through the latest case analysis.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
